{"title":"Wyrm Hide","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Sand Wyrmling, Old Maw, Sand Wyrm</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"sand-wyrm\" title=\"Old Maw - dropped it in 9 of 9 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/da25370d9ff1caef2f04.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Old Maw</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"sand-wyrmling\" title=\"Sand Wyrmling - dropped it in 16 of 24 looted corpses (1/1.5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/ca7435ecfe8bb6141971.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sand Wyrmling</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–4</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"wyrm-hide\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/97b6093fa51dfdf6f46d.svg\" alt=\"Wyrm Hide\"></div><h3>Wyrm Hide</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/19/2026, 10:03:53 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}